prompt_template.instructions:
Draft a B2B proposal using the following inputs.

## Client Name
{{client_name}}

## Client Problem
{{client_problem}}

## Desired Outcome
{{desired_outcome}}

## Offer
{{offer}}

## Scope
{{scope}}

## Timeline (operator-provided)
{{timeline}}

## Investment (operator-provided)
{{investment}}

## Proof Points (use only these — do not invent others)
{{proof_points}}

## Tone
{{tone}}

Requirements:
- Use only the proof points listed above; if none provided, proof_points_used must be empty.
- Use timeline and investment only if provided; otherwise note gaps in missing_information.
- Keep language concise and client-appropriate.
- Do not add warranties, SLAs, or legal clauses unless explicitly provided in inputs.
